    "background": "A warm cream ground (#F4ECDC) filling the entire panel. The lower two-thirds of the frame is left as generous empty cream space, with the botanical border occupying only the upper quarter to third along the top edge. Pure line illustration — no fills, no shading, no gradients, no halftone. Every line rendered in a single forest green ink (#2F5D3A).",
