        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Live oak branch running horizontally across the top edge of the panel, spanning nearly the full width. Gnarled twisting trunk with characteristic deeply furrowed bark rendered in fine linework, slightly heavier line weight than the foliage. Secondary smaller branches fork upward and outward from the main limb, terminating in clusters of small oval live oak leaves drawn as simple closed contours in finer linework. Symmetrical balance with organic asymmetry, evenly weighted left-to-right but not perfectly mirrored."
