      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Long strands of Spanish moss hanging in soft cascading tassels from multiple points along the main branch and its secondary limbs. Each strand rendered as a thin tapered line with subtle frayed ends in fine forest green ink. The tassels hang at varied lengths creating a gentle undulating silhouette along the bottom edge of the border."
