        "desc": "Mother standing on the second porch step behind the dogs, in three-quarter front view facing the camera, gaze directed down at the dogs with a warm easy smile. Cream linen blouse with short sleeves, rolled khaki trousers, shoulder-length light brown hair. Her right hand rests gently on the beagle's back beside her. Medium skin tone, natural detailed skin texture, eyes catching the soft daylight."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Father standing to the mother's right on the second step, in three-quarter front view, weight on his back foot, both hands tucked into his trouser pockets, looking down at the dogs with a quiet closed-mouth smile. Forest-green short-sleeve button-down shirt, dark chinos, short brown hair, light stubble, medium skin tone."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Young daughter around eight years old kneeling on the lower step between the two dogs, in three-quarter front view facing slightly right toward the beagle, head tilted down with eyes on the dog, mouth open in a soft laugh showing teeth. Pale copper sundress with thin straps, light skin tone, long straight light-brown hair falling forward. Both hands cupped under the beagle's chin mid-pet."
